    {
      "id": "claim_b74b8d9a07af43d19d094ac0a3c0df4c",
      "statement": "Configuration for this project has multiple distinct owners: pyproject.toml + uv.lock define the Python dependency graph, .env supplies local secrets, GraphSettings.from_env() snapshots RAG runtime choices, langgraph.json selects graphs/auth/custom app/API version/store index, Compose supplies local service overrides, and Fly manifests/workflows provide deployed topology; an env var consumed by one surface is not automatically consumed by another.",
