      "id": "claim_edc473499e354b19833e84a9258444e0",
      "statement": "`make weaviate` runs `docker compose up -d` and then polls `http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1/.well-known/ready` in a loop until it succeeds before reporting the service ready.",
