    {
      "id": "claim_ab70251a14b94ed48af66b885011c646",
      "statement": "`make ingest` invokes healthcare_rag/storage/vector_store.py with `--delete-all`, which deletes every existing Weaviate collection in the persistent volume before loading the checked-in Lipitor and Metformin chunk files, so it is scoped as a full destructive rebuild and should only be run when that erasure is intended.",
