    {
      "id": "claim_9b79d1c8d53c4e88a7f911bef037a203",
      "statement": "The Weaviate loader (vector_store.py import_data) batches inserts at 100 objects by default, silently skips any row missing a `text` property, stops the import early once batch errors exceed 10, and only logs an approximate success count — so a non-crashing `make ingest` run is not proof that ingestion fully or correctly completed.",
