    {
      "id": "claim_87b0961601f84ea9b8d96df33d1e52b8",
      "statement": "The interactive CLI (`make run` / `python -m healthcare_rag`) waits up to 30 seconds for a raw preliminary answer, prints it labeled 'not verified', then continues processing and prints a separate validated 'VERIFIED ANSWER' once the pipeline completes; the preliminary answer is not citation-validated and must not be treated as a safety boundary.",
      "evidence": [
