      "statement": "Rechunking source PDFs requires installing the `ingest` optional extra (docling, transformers) and running healthcare_rag/processors/pdf_chunker.py (or the ingestion CLI); because regeneration changes expected chunk IDs and pages, the golden dataset and evals must be updated in the same change, and PDF contents must not be inspected or copied into documentation.",
