        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_82a7d51aad834f2da81f6daca519a968",
      "statement": "Because the interactive CLI's init-failure message is deliberately generic, diagnosing a startup failure requires checking the two concrete underlying causes directly: `Resources.weaviate()` and `vector_store.connect_to_weaviate()` both raise a `ValueError` when `OPENAI_API_KEY` is unset, and Weaviate connection failures (container not running, still starting, or `WEAVIATE_HOST`/`WEAVIATE_PORT`/`WEAVIATE_GRPC_PORT` mismatched with Compose's `127.0.0.1:8080`/`50051` defaults) surface as connection errors or `weaviate.exceptions.WeaviateStartUpError` from the same code path.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/graph/resources.py#L66-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d2bd1a9874b6987295ac5a7a7583f8c37d67d830a63c96d4b33d86f572116879:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/graph/settings.py#L46-L46",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2d2f35423af83935fa32a615bc223cf67d2b688f01537e3f4db4ea5ea6185bd8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://healthcare_rag/storage/vector_store.py#L56-L98",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b8501af626d428e5c55a659f2f4e6c87e922fdd9e21e51d52c0ba3aeb9a16c6d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_64d5d26c254a4fa5bb4afdd65a6ad9e8",
      "statement": "The Compose `healthcare-rag` app service (built by `make container-build`, used by `make container-ingest`/`make container-run`) declares `depends_on: weaviate: condition: service_healthy`, so it will not start until Weaviate's own container healthcheck (an HTTP GET against `/v1/.well-known/ready` every 2s, up to 30 retries, with a 5s start period) succeeds; this is a separate wait mechanism from `make weaviate`'s Makefile-level curl polling loop used for the non-containerized workflow.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Makefile#L27-L29",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b696b9db6fa08246131f190efea1252af905f1daecbd3f1218941138ac22cdf4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L18-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6084ed3d1125f4abb61bc2da92702b84f08e5cb5d8143b85c1e8987cc17cef6f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e895913f3e994be6877996ce3506bf4d",
      "statement": "The Compose `healthcare-rag` app service runs with `read_only: true` and only `/tmp` mounted writable via `tmpfs`, so any code path invoked through `container-ingest`/`container-run` that attempts to write outside `/tmp` (e.g. exploratory scratch output) will fail; the non-containerized equivalents (`make ingest`/`make run` against `.venv`) do not have this restriction.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L31-L54",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:93d3e24f733d5652a932e1a4e18e41dc7f0505d449403dc23eafb7d23c67ab31:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
