      "statement": "`make deployed-smoke-gate` runs the same `scripts/deployed_smoke.py` tool as `make deployed-smoke` but with `--profile gate`, giving a fast, LLM-free subset of the ten-check smoke suite against `LANGGRAPH_DEPLOYMENT_URL`, intended for quick checks where the full smoke's latency/cost is not warranted.",
